---
description: Database, migrations, and the trace chain
globs: app/db/**, alembic/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Models in `app/db/models.py` (SQLModel). Every schema change ships with an Alembic migration in the same commit. Never edit an applied migration.
- The trace chain must stay intact: sources -> stories -> script_lines -> claims -> claim_evidence. Foreign keys with explicit `ondelete` behavior.
- Embeddings in pgvector columns with an HNSW index. Embedding model and dimension come from config and are recorded in `context/nodes/data-model.md`.
- Dedupe sources by `content_hash` and URL canonicalization before insert.
- Update `context/nodes/data-model.md` whenever a table or column changes.
